      "cooked": "<p>Had an odd thing happen in a Vengeance game, wanted to get some feedback.</p>\n<p>I placed one of Chrono Ranger’s bounties on a nemesis, one of the villain targets from the deck. I then incapacitated that villain, so all of his cards left play.</p>\n<p>But the attachment wasn’t destroyed when that happened. Best as I can tell, it left play with the nemesis. (I’ve been trying to repeat this. Why it should be so much trouble is beyond me.)</p>\n<p>Is this intended?</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:48:39.966Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
