      "raw": "Had an odd thing happen in a Vengeance game, wanted to get some feedback.\r\n\r\nI placed one of Chrono Ranger's bounties on a nemesis, one of the villain targets from the deck. I then incapacitated that villain, so all of his cards left play. \r\n\r\nBut the attachment wasn't destroyed when that happened. Best as I can tell, it left play with the nemesis. (I've been trying to repeat this. Why it should be so much trouble is beyond me.)\r\n\r\nIs this intended?",
