      "cooked": "<p><span>Interesting – since Vengeance-format villains are incapped&nbsp;</span><strong><em>instead</em></strong><span>&nbsp;of destroyed, they probably don’t trigger the “on destruction” effects of the bounties?&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span>Could also depend on the bounty, as they don’t all work the same.&nbsp; <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slightly_smiling_face.png?v=9\" title=\":slightly_smiling_face:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slightly_smiling_face:\"> </span></p>",
